      "example": "The pay is good. That said, the hours are pretty long.",
      "usage_note": "通常放在句首，后接逗号，语气比 but 更从容。"
    },
    {
      "expression": "suits me best",
      "meaning_zh": "最适合我",
      "why_useful": "表达个人适配度的地道搭配，可用于工作、生活方式、学习安排等多种话题。",
      "example": "A quiet cafe suits me best when I need to study.",
      "usage_note": "主语可以是事物或安排，如 a hybrid setup suits me best。"
    }
